@startuml
actor Student
participant WalletPanel as UI
participant WalletFacade as Facade
participant FeeStrategy as Strategy
participant "TransactionBuilder" as Builder
participant TransferAuthenticator as Auth
participant AuthenticatedSender as Decorator
participant NetworkSender as Sender
participant LocalChainAdapter as Adapter
participant LocalChainNode as Node
participant TransactionHistory as History
note over Facade,History
  During construction: Facade subscribes history::onConfirmation through Adapter.
end note
Student -> UI: Review transfer
UI -> Facade: prepare(recipient, inputAmount, strategy)
Facade -> Strategy: calculate(amount)
Strategy --> Facade: fee
Facade -> Builder: recipient(...).amount(...).fee(...).build()
Builder --> Facade: validated immutable Transaction
Facade -> Adapter: validate(transaction)
Adapter -> Node: validate(payment in minor units)
Facade -> Auth: issue(transaction)
Auth --> Facade: demo code
Facade --> UI: PreparedTransfer
Student -> UI: Authorize & send
UI -> Facade: submit(transfer, pin, code)
Facade -> Decorator: send(transaction, credentials)
Decorator -> Auth: verify(transaction, credentials)
alt invalid, expired or used credentials
  Auth --> UI: IllegalArgumentException via call stack
else valid credentials
  Decorator -> Sender: send(transaction, credentials)
  Sender -> Adapter: broadcast(transaction)
  Adapter -> Node: broadcast(payment)
  Node --> Adapter: numeric IN_POOL receipt
  Adapter --> Facade: PENDING receipt via senders
  Facade -> History: recordSubmission(transaction, receipt)
  Facade --> UI: PENDING receipt
end
Student -> UI: Create block
UI -> Facade: createBlock()
Facade -> Adapter: createBlock()
Adapter -> Node: mine()
Node -> Node: sort payments, commit balances and linked block
loop each confirmation and subscriber
  Node -> Adapter: included receipt callback
  Adapter -> History: onConfirmation(translated receipt)
  note right of Node: Subscriber failures are logged; delivery continues.
end
Node --> Adapter: Block
Adapter --> Facade: BlockSummary
Facade --> UI: BlockSummary
UI -> Facade: balances(), history()
Facade --> UI: confirmed balances and updated history
@enduml
